<title>SOUTH AFRICA: METAIR RENEWS CAUTIONARY FOR A TRANSACTION.</title>
<headline>METAIR RENEWS CAUTIONARY FOR A TRANSACTION.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metair Investments Ltd on Wednesday renewed a cautionary first issued on March 11, saying it was still involved in an investigation of a possible transaction.</p>
<p>It therefore urged shareholders to continue to exercise caution when dealing in Metair shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
